From e603df37ee3c2810c554ad8d1edc65c706cb85ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:52:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Tamer looks: Jijimon asks boy or girl, and the Look page
 opens on his black screen

A new game asks who the tamer is among Jijimon's questions (lookPageQuiz, the states from 0x30 of newGameStateMachine).
After his seven questions he asks boy or girl, as a list like theirs; a girl starts from a look made for her. After the
name he asks what the tamer looks like and the Look page opens with no window: the tamer on the left, every row on the
right, the turn and Save hints and a line saying the look can be changed later in the menu.

The page is a state of the questions, a frame of it per frame of the scene. The tamer is loaded for it and unloaded
after it; his object is removed meanwhile. The title's overlays are read again first, in the language chosen since.
---
 src/main/game_menu.c   | 168 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/shop/script_menu.c |   9 ++-
 text/main/mod_lab.yaml |   3 +
 3 files changed, 175 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

